<title>INDIA: YIELD ON INDIA 14-DAY T-BILL UNCHANGED AT 4.96 PCT.</title>
<headline>YIELD ON INDIA 14-DAY T-BILL UNCHANGED AT 4.96 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off rate of 99.81 rupees at its 14-day treasury bill auction on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield worked out to 4.96 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
